/-!
# The symplectic branch of Section 12.8

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
manuscript of 1 March 2004, Lemmas 12.8.11–12, printed pp.854–855.

This module proves 12.8.11(1–2) and 12.8.12(2) from the stated earlier
§12.8 clauses. The subgroups, the central quotient U/Z(U), the faithful
quotient H/ker(ρ), and the images of H∩G₂ and T are literal constructions.
The Frattini argument proves elementary abelianness of E itself; the
four-group argument discharges the point-plane stabilizer factorization.

The full transvection action, fixed-space equality, rank identity and
low-rank witness of 12.8.11(3–6) remain required. Construction of the
G.10.1/G.11.1 configurations and application of the genuine G.11.2
classification also remain required. No conditional declaration here
asserts those remaining source conclusions.
-/
